	(text "One channel of the KQME board (Missing Mile Modular/KQME). The board carries this circuit twice,\none per quantizer, sharing nothing: the second channel is J4-J6, U2, R6-R10, D2, C2.\nThe J2 PIN labels are the quantizer's serial header. On the board they arrive on a 1x5 header\n(J3, J6) carrying J2 pins 1 to 5 in order; pins 1 and 2 are both ground."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 76.2 104.14 0)
		(effects
